63: Class `Nette\Iterators\Mapper` is deprecated: call `Nette\Utils\Iterables::map()`, which returns a generator that can be iterated only once instead of a rewindable iterator, since nette/utils 4.0.5.
64: Class `Nette\Iterators\Filter` is replaced by `CallbackFilterIterator`.
65: Constructor `Nette\Iterators\CachingIterator::__construct()` is replaced by `new \Nette\Iterators\CachingIterator(iterable: $i, ...)`.
