79: Static method `Nette\Utils\Image::calculateSize()` is replaced by `calculateSize(mode: $f, ...)`.
79: Constant `Nette\Utils\Image::EXACT` is replaced by `Image::Cover`.
80: Static method `Nette\Utils\Image::rgb()` is deprecated: call `Nette\Utils\ImageColor::rgb()`, which returns an object instead of an array and takes opacity as a float 0..1 instead of transparency 0..127, since nette/utils 4.0.3.
81: Method `Nette\Utils\Image::dashedLine()` is removed: set a style with `setStyle()` and draw with `line()`, the GD function behind it being deprecated in PHP, since nette/utils 3.1.3.
