93: Static method `Nette\Utils\Finder::findFiles()` is deprecated: pass the masks as one array, since nette/utils 4.0.
93: Method `Nette\Utils\Finder::in()` is deprecated: pass the paths as one array, since nette/utils 4.0.
94: Method `Nette\Utils\Finder::count()` is replaced by `\count(collect())`.
95: Static method `Nette\Utils\Finder::compare()` is replaced by `Nette\Utils\Helpers::compare()`.
102: Static method `Nette\Utils\Reflection::getParameterType()` is removed: call `Nette\Utils\Type::fromReflection()`, which returns a `Nette\Utils\Type` object instead of a string, and call its methods, such as `getSingleName()`, since nette/utils 3.2.10.
103: Static method `Nette\Utils\Reflection::getReturnTypes()` is removed: call `Nette\Utils\Type::fromReflection()` and ask the object it returns for `getNames()`, since nette/utils 3.1.6.
104: Static method `Nette\Utils\Reflection::isBuiltinType()` is replaced by `Nette\Utils\Validators::isBuiltinType()`.
105: Method `Nette\Utils\Type::isSingle()` is replaced by `Type::isSimple()`.
106: Method `Nette\Utils\Type::allows()` is replaced by `allows(type: $t, ...)`.
107: Static method `Nette\Utils\Type::resolve()` is replaced by `resolve(of: $r, ...)`.
112: Class `Nette\Utils\IHtmlString` is replaced by `Nette\HtmlStringable`.
114: Static property `Nette\Utils\Html::$xhtml` is removed: there is no replacement; the output is always HTML5; drop the setting, since nette/utils 4.0.
115: Method `Nette\Utils\Html::add()` is replaced by `Html::addHtml()`.
116: Static method `Nette\Utils\DateTime::createFromFormat()` is replaced by `createFromFormat(datetime: $t, ...)`.
117: Static method `Nette\Utils\ArrayHash::from()` is replaced by `from(array: $a, ...)`.
