123: Static method `Nette\Utils\Html::fromText()` is replaced by `Html::text()`.
124: Method `Nette\Utils\Html::text()` is deprecated: call `setText()` for the content or `setAttribute('text', ...)` for the attribute, since nette/utils 4.1.5.
125: Method `Nette\Utils\Html::html()` is deprecated: call `setHtml()` for the content or `setAttribute('html', ...)` for the attribute, since nette/utils 4.1.5.
126: Static method `Nette\Utils\Json::decode()` takes `forceArrays: true` instead of `Json::FORCE_ARRAY`.
127: Constant `Nette\Utils\Json::PRETTY` is deprecated: pass `pretty: true` to `encode()`, since nette/utils 4.0.
127: Constant `Nette\Utils\Json::ESCAPE_UNICODE` is deprecated: pass `asciiSafe: true` to `encode()`, since nette/utils 4.0.
128: Constant `Nette\Utils\Json::FORCE_ARRAY` is deprecated: pass `forceArrays: true` to `decode()`, since nette/utils 4.0.
129: Static method `Nette\Utils\Strings::match()` takes `captureOffset: true` instead of `PREG_OFFSET_CAPTURE`.
130: Static method `Nette\Utils\Strings::matchAll()` needs no argument for `PREG_SET_ORDER`, which must be left out.
