132: Static method `Nette\Utils\Arrays::grep()` takes `invert: true` instead of `PREG_GREP_INVERT`.
139: Class `Nette\Object` is removed: use the trait `Nette\SmartObject` instead of extending a base class, since nette/utils 3.0.
140: Static method `Nette\Utils\ObjectMixin::strictGet()` is replaced by `Nette\Utils\ObjectHelpers::strictGet()`.
143: Static method `Nette\Utils\Validators::isType()` is deprecated: test with `class_exists()`, `interface_exists()` or `trait_exists()`, since nette/utils 4.0.
144: Static method `Nette\Utils\ObjectMixin::setExtensionMethod()` is removed: there is no replacement; the extension methods of `Nette\SmartObject` are gone, since nette/utils 3.0.
148: Static method `Nette\Utils\ObjectMixin::call()` is removed: there is no replacement; the mechanism of `Nette\Object` it served is gone, since nette/utils 3.0.
149: Class `Nette\StaticClassException` is removed: catch `\Error`, which `Nette\StaticClass` throws on instantiation, since nette/utils 3.0.
150: Constant `Nette\Utils\RegexpException::MESSAGES` is removed: call `preg_last_error_msg()`, since nette/utils 4.0.
160: Method `Nette\Utils\Html::fromText()` is replaced by `Html::text()`.
161: Method `Nette\Utils\Html::html()` is deprecated: call `setHtml()` for the content or `setAttribute('html', ...)` for the attribute, since nette/utils 4.1.5.
